        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The approaches we are disrupting include market research companies such as NIQ and Kantar Group, traditional media measurement solutions such as Nielsen Corporation and Comscore, Inc., project-based approaches to specific business challenges provided by management consulting companies (e.g.",
        "start_character": 44010,
        "end_character": 44301
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our website, and through a popular browser extension, we provide free access to a wide range of basic services that provide users with a subset of our robust insights and analytics as well as the opportunity to explore the value they could achieve from our paid offerings.",
        "start_character": 41502,
        "end_character": 41782
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide advisory services, typically to businesses at the enterprise and strategic account level who require assistance with business challenges for which we have not yet productized a solution or who need extensively customized data and analytics to accomplish their objectives using Similarweb Digital Data.",
        "start_character": 5928,
        "end_character": 6245
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are guided in all of our activities by the doctrine of “privacy by design” – we strive to avoid or minimize the collection of personal data, and to collect only the minimal data needed for the development and maintenance of our solutions and the operation of our business.",
        "start_character": 47949,
        "end_character": 48224
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We estimate that the current total addressable market, or TAM, for our offerings is approximately $55 billion.",
        "start_character": 9094,
        "end_character": 9204
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell to companies with commercial activities in the digital world across a wide range of industries such as retail, consumer packaged goods, luxury & premium consumer brands, consumer finance, consultancies, marketing and advertising agencies, media and publishers, business-to-business software, payment processors, travel, and institutional investors, as well as to organizations building data-driven and AI-enabled products and services.",
        "start_character": 6676,
        "end_character": 7119
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we are well known for our productized software solutions, as well as for our application programming interface (API), our model context protocol (MCP) and our freemium offerings estimating website and app usage, at our core we are a data business.",
        "start_character": 1749,
        "end_character": 2002
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we have partnered with Manus to integrate our data into workflows designed to support marketing analysis, competitive assessment, and related use cases.",
        "start_character": 37479,
        "end_character": 37644
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that our sales and marketing model provides us with a competitive advantage because we attract and engage new businesses efficiently and at scale, and we have established a successful upsell motion to grow existing customer accounts.",
        "start_character": 39527,
        "end_character": 39771
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We complement this inbound motion with an outbound motion focused on developing sales opportunities with larger targeted accounts, where our sales representatives engage organizations based on a geographic coverage model.",
        "start_character": 40313,
        "end_character": 40534
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001842731-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001842731-26-000018-c44f0e94dece406f",
        "accession_number": "0001842731-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have consistently developed and delivered cutting-edge capabilities for our users.",
